@host = http://localhost:5160

### 1. Caso Exitoso (200 OK) - 1 kg, VIP y Express = 7.00
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 1.0,
  "tipoCliente": "VIP",
  "tipoEnvio": "Express"
}

### 2. Caso Exitoso (200 OK) - 5.5 kg, Frecuente y Express
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 5.5,
  "tipoCliente": "Frecuente",
  "tipoEnvio": "Express"
}

### 3. Error de Negocio (422 Unprocessable Entity) - Regla BR-02 (Peso > 20kg)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 22.5,
  "tipoCliente": "Nuevo",
  "tipoEnvio": "Estandar"
}

### 4. Error Sintáctico / Validación DTO (400 Bad Request) - Payload inválido
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quotes/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": -5.0,
  "tipoCliente": "",
  "tipoEnvio": null
}
